    "title": "Butler County Animal Shelter holds adoptions during the 45th Buick GS Nationals - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Gus Warren ,\n7 hours ago BOWLING GREEN, Ky. – When you come to Beech Bend Raceway, you’re usually there for a few things: loud cars, good food and… pet adoptions?. During the Buick GS Nationals from April 29 to May 2, the Butler County Animal Shelter, along with other shelters, have partnered to hold adoptions throughout the event. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
